                    },
                    "message": "what does \"GPU 0\" Describe?  In the way EM configs are normally done, this would generally be another exposes record.  In this way if you have 3 layers of bridges (Bridge to bridge to end device) you can still describe it."
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform_configurations/nvidia/mgx_connectx8_supernic_switch_server.json",
                    "line": 20,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Harshit Aghera",
                        "email": "haghera@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "harshit-aghera"
                    },
                    "message": "From where should we obtain configuration properties (NvidiaMctpVdm for nvidia-gpu application for example) other than Name for BridgedEndpoints? By using Board property to find the EM inventory path that has configuration? If yes then what if two BridgedEndpoints corresponds to two different EM inventory path, or that is not supported? And if multiple BridgedEndpoints (and also bridge?) has their configurations (NvidiaMctpVdm for nvidia-gpu application for example) on the same EM inventory path how can we associate different configuration to individual BridgedEndpoints?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform_configurations/nvidia/mgx_connectx8_supernic_switch_server.json",
                    "line": 20,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Deepak Kodihalli",
                        "email": "deepak.kodihalli.83@gmail.com",
                        "username": "dkodihal"
                    },
                    "message": "NvidiaMctpVdm is in the previous patch. Please review the nvidia-gpu patch for bridged endpoints handling (you may already have - \"Board\" property is used).\n\nWe can certainly add more config here if that's you main concern (I'm not sure I followed all the questions). It's an array of strings (names) now but we can add more as need be."
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform_configurations/nvidia/mgx_connectx8_supernic_switch_server.json",
                    "line": 100,
                    "reviewer": {
