                        "username": "molbear"
                    },
                    "message": "we chatted offline, but its not clear to me how pldmd is going to discover this info without an appropriate mctpreactor association."
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform_configurations/nvidia/mgx_connectx8_supernic_switch_server.json",
                    "line": 100,
                    "reviewer": {
